      "text": [
        " سَمِعْتُ أَبَا جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ يَقُولُ: \"مَا أُحِبُّ لِلرَّجُلِ اَلْمُسْلِمِ أَنْ يَتَزَوَّجَ اِمْرَأَةً إِذَا كَانَتْ ضَرَّةً لِأُمِّهِ مَعَ غَيْرِ أَبِيهِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4429 - Al-Hasan ibn Mahbub narrated from Jamil ibn Salih, from Zurara, who said:\nI heard Abu Jafar Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as) say: \"I do not like for a Muslim man to marry a woman who would be a co-wife to his mother, with someone other than his father.\""
        ]
      }
